# Editor/OS cruft at the monorepo root. Each platform subdirectory (CovenantMac/,
# CovenantWin/) has its own .gitignore for its own generated/ephemeral artifacts —
# this file only covers things that could land at the repo root.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# This is a Claude Code session's own local settings, not product content —
# never meant to be committed to the Covenant repo itself.
/.claude/
